{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-12","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：立方与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Between two cube numbers there are two mean proportional numbers, and the cube has to the cube the ratio triplicate of that which the side has to the side.","book":8,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","contentId":"euclid-8-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8643ef1107afd795d4d84c7442180dd08fad0ec9ee8af7b54b712a6b60885e09","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-12.statement","euclid-8-12.construction.1","euclid-8-12.construction.2","euclid-8-12.proof.1","euclid-8-12.proof.2","euclid-8-12.proof.3","euclid-8-12.proof.4","euclid-8-12.proof.5","euclid-8-12.proof.6","euclid-8-12.proof.7","euclid-8-12.proof.8","euclid-8-12.proof.9","euclid-8-12.proof.10","euclid-8-12.proof.11","euclid-8-12.proof.12","euclid-8-12.proof.13","euclid-8-12.conclusion","euclid-8-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae3a7688c25ac5bc92121fe956aefe33bd0bd60361c76399126636ca32962d33","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Between two cube numbers there are two mean proportional numbers, and the cube has to the cube the ratio triplicate of that which the side has to the side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两个立方数之间,有两个比例中项个数字, 立方体与立方体的比重是三重, 方体与方体的比重是另一边的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3acda5a9e5583c686db82fe7ff5b0f3b28c8c6bd9c16553b87e9f066f2ebf4be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be cube numbers, and let C be the side of A, and D of B; I say that between A, B there are two mean proportional numbers, and A has to B the ratio triplicate of that which C has to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B是立方数,C是A,B是D;我说,A,B是2,比例中项,A是C,D是C,B,A是B,A是B,A,A是C,B,B是C,D,B,B是C,B,"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7609af7d9879d352c759e74d6c7ef1fb263b31d12a3b0b19ed2c719477f5b075","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let C by multiplying itself make E, and by multiplying D let it make F; let D by multiplying itself make G, and let the numbers C, D by multiplying F make H, K respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C乘以E乘以D乘以F;D乘以G,C乘以F,D乘以H,K。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25e7d9ec77cc76ccdeef674d2225e6cdada40672cf6c7674fa87bff63b5a386b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A is a cube, and C its side, and C by multiplying itself has made E, therefore C by multiplying itself has made E and by multiplying E has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A是立方体,C是其侧面,C乘以本身就已经形成E,因此C乘以本身就形成了E,乘以E就形成了A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2086d71872ac925f59d0af03a3b3300e2796f233d9cc4a244ba904c3f654e48","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also D by multiplying itself has made G and by multiplying G has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,D乘以本身就达到G,G乘以本身就达到B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7acc353dda2c2a7528a18ec66e004228c764a30ff06d32d09601d4e361cc606","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since C by multiplying the numbers C, D has made E, F respectively, therefore, as C is to D, so is E to F. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C乘以C,D 分别是E,F,C,C比E；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02c2e857064f13b13ddb7e1911cc30b0faca283709f9fcb230d1cdeefdbf03e5","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as C is to D, so is F to G. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,C比D的比例等于F比G；C 与 D 之比等于 F 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5a20f9e4648271771d6a4e2784d4b845cc5577228f14f76b69bd1e21b3175a5","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since C by multiplying the numbers E, F has made A, H respectively, therefore, as E is to F, so is A to H. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自C乘以E、F后,A、H的比例分别为E和F,相当于A和H；E 与 F 之比等于 A 与 H 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"474ac1bf83432552bbcf48df34eefdcecd4e2196d1229adfb7ddb643dbc0988b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as E is to F, so is C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E比F的比等于C比D；E 与 F 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffed2dd1ddcf2b7316bc5e85c5db3e60c0c254e190f129823327bc666f7a3964","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as C is to D, so is A to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C比D的比例也等于A比H；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"391464d60997fc1f9ca58d0d4a59b5dca490b3f70c1a2009ca0eebf5261dc921","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the numbers C, D by multiplying F have made H, K respectively, therefore, as C is to D, so is H to K. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于C,D乘以F,分别使H,K,C比D等于H比K；C 与 D 之比等于 H 与 K 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b1119839b0e3f3bf3e5fccd0e97be5cb96ef97b21317e5d419ee4cc939207cc8","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since D by multiplying each of the numbers F, G has made K, B respectively, therefore, as F is to G, so is K to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自D乘以F、G后,K、B的比例分别为K、B,F对G的比例相当于K对B的比例；F 与 G 之比等于 K 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e60ea274a0445ca289d70d8a77ee71d26aa6fe1785b16ef5ddd5058a78b72b6a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as F is to G, so is C to D; therefore also, as C is to D, so is A to H, H to K, and K to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,F对G的比等于C对D的比;因此,C对D的比等于A对H、H对K和B的比；F 与 G 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd4b42c22652e190c8dc02923e82fc5ac7f786d47f77daa65445fa8266e2e3cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore H, K are two mean proportionals between A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,H,K是2 平均成比例 在A,B之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2cb24848228d5811e4ad9f30df24cf165d4b787a766cff8905d11706796da93","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that A also has to B the ratio triplicate of that which C has to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,A比还有B,C比的三倍,D比的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86c33cf2e7f0aa97b1a6ed77a178255c45634b09fae7ca847cb7f046ba4e413e","citations":["euclid-5-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, H, K, B are four numbers in proportion, therefore A has to B the ratio triplicate of that which A has to H. [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A以来,H、K、B的比例为4个,因此A的比例为B,而A的比例为H的比例为H。 [[V. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-5-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":16,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08fa02f3e408103342e2865701ac4dfbc18ec1653ac9cdca89567baf572b7ca9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to H, so is C to D; therefore A also has to B the ratio triplicate of that which C has to D. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对H的比等于C对D的比;因此,A对B的比也是C对D的比的三倍；A 与 H 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-12.source","contentId":"euclid-8-12","revisionId":"euclid-8-12@raw-8643ef1107afd795","order":17,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07e48494032007dc9344ba64f82260a293eb4783e26fa0033770f0065d10a456","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-12:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-12.proof.3","euclid-8-12.proof.5","euclid-8-12.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-12:euclid-7-18: